# Concrete decision or mechanism

Explain the mechanism and its assumptions. Replace every placeholder, including the generation event, before use.[^primary]

## Consequence under failure

Give a concrete trigger, the violated invariant, the observable symptom, and a recovery strategy. Distinguish your engineering deduction from the documented premise.

## Decision and verification

Compare meaningful alternatives when needed. Describe a discriminating experiment, its expected observable result, and what the experiment cannot establish. Do not invent measured outcomes.

